Package: capemlGIS
Title: CAP LTER package for generating EML spatialRaster metadata
Version: 1.11.0
Authors@R: person("S", "Earl", email = "stevan.earl@asu.edu",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An extension of the CAPLTER/capeml package intended to facilitate
  the creation of EML spatialRaster metadata to support publishing spatial
  raster data and metadata resources in the Environmental Data Initiative (EDI)
  data repository. For vector data (spatialVector) metadata, see the companion
  CAPLTER/capemlVector package.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
